<td valign="top">

<h1>Viewing output files</h1>

Once the file has been downloaded, right-clicking on the file again will show options 
to view the (now local) file.
</p>
The default and alternate viewers refer to the two programs mentioned in the 
configuration step: in this case, WordPad (the default for Windows) and XEmacs (the 
selected alternate viewer). If no alternate viewer has been selected, this second menu 
option will not appear.

